3244337/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL80zknwn4zHhllxGipfMFKUPla1AlXhZ5wxtah7zPLaM4V=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"3 months ago","text":"We loved this shop! They have ps5 with all the games perfect for mates and the area outside is so comfy! Defo recommend","time":1729308232,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Jimmy Croft","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109791549196620172456/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVB7QolxLDAJOxWgwDEQCMDjviqHrYopbMivv3YeXgoFQB4q9lbQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"5 months ago","text":"Loved the White Runtz, great selection of top grade BudZ! Diamond Bud also stocks the very best vape gear too. Playstation and lounge area included. Five star. Cheers!","time":1725285672,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Shreya Mendhekar","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117282326557144154891/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXAOvKWEw7Dxj5mtr7fPfiQpim4i4UU1PcuFM1Bv7P-gq6hgfH6-A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"2 months ago","text":"We absolutely loved this place during our time in Koh Samui. The atmosphere is super chill, with a cozy and aesthetically pleasing vibe that makes you want to stay for hours. They have an impressive collection of collectibles and paraphernalia, which adds to the charm.\n\nA special shoutout to Pink, who was incredibly friendly and welcoming—she made us feel right at home. This spot is a must-visit, and we highly recommend it to anyone looking for a laid-back and memorable experience!","time":1732001766,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Sophie Foote","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103725652291772408827/reviews","language":"en","or