p! The owner is lovely and have many cute cats","time":1719385402,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Danas Uscinas","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101017489961260834185/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVW2rXSXSUwxlXDs8zue_vtdVUpUOZupgEfxRuCcxMB1jqkl2F5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"3 months ago","text":"Very cozy place, the owner is very friendly and it’s so much fun when cats around. Product is also very good 😳","time":1729333913,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Chey Gurearra","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116607798761119129785/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKSdEoHcIT9PM5c9_WRAwyEx8Jcepv8iQTXgSHGQTQ_2rjo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"7 months ago","text":"Great weed better person serving it it is a must see destination in samui","time":1719415360,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Marek Matoušek","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102894425874900792659/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1QMfhDE3Cp_18xqfa4-rbmsN1AxZxISgX_Kr0bWS-pWNSZXIi=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"4 months ago","text":"Best price/quality ratio we ever saw in Thailand","time":1728581270,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Phii Kab","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100783163259101374443/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJz71lQotI2RKxbjw04jJ5IZJM82OSDlae7AJqf3froBxiY4w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"7 months ago","text":"Very nice shop, very fair prices and the best Costumer service.","time":1720691222,"translated":false}],"reviews_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJVboezTvzVDARmC85LmJEv4c"},{"place_id":"ChIJA1St3-nzVDARcbv1l1hQO8M","name":"Ganja Nostra","address":"139, T, 76, Tambon Maret, Amphoe Ko Samui, Chang Wat Surat Thani 84310, Thailand","phone_number":"062 049 4289","geometry":{"location":{"lat":9.4704646,"lng":100.0480697},"viewport":{"northeast":{"lat":9.471840980291502,"lng":100.0494531302915},"southwest":{"lat":9.469143019708497,"lng":100.0467551697085}}},"opening_hours":{"open_now":false,"periods":[{"close":{"day":0,"time":"2200"},"open":{"day":0,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":1,"time":"2200"},"open":{"day":1,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":2,"time":"2200"},"open":{"day":2,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":3,"time":"2200"},"open":{"day":3,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":4,"time":"2200"},"open":{"day":4,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":5,"time":"2200"},"open":{"day":5,"time":"1100"}},{"close":{"day":6,"time":"2200"},"open":{"day":6,"time":"1100"}}],"weekday_text":["Monday: 11:00 AM – 10:00 PM","Tuesday: 11:00 AM – 10:00 PM","Wednesday: 11:00 AM – 10:00 PM","Thursday: 11:00 AM – 10:00 PM","Friday: 11:00 AM – 10:00 PM","Saturday: 11:00 AM – 10:00 PM","Sunday: 11:00 AM – 10:00 PM"]},"rating":5,"user_ratings_total":23,"reviews":[{"author_name":"Yam Y","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106869712464939936529/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK0Dl_zLrWEbaVTQwtW4ud3RvEqtRy1NBzr4ZoLAGYL5rAFVg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"a week ago","text":"AMAZING local buds, best prices, and by far the nicest staff around.\nThe lady at the counter was so kind. She even allowed us in the back to check the crops.\nHIGHLY RECOMMEND!","time":1738331401,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Diana Merra","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100000430228236490313/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJk0T5t3YtwuHzAxQ4IZzo0Vlnk0N9FsV1lh-xGggTVE14RHA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"11 months ago","text":"Nestled in the vibrant community of Lamai, Koh Samui, this shop stands out for its exceptional quality and diverse selection of weeds.\nMoreover, the shop's staff are friendly and dedicated to providing excellent customer service. They take the time to understand each customer's preferences and offer personalized recommendations to ensure satisfaction with every purchase.\nAdditionally, the shop's convenient location in Lamai makes it easily accessible to both locals and tourists alike. Whether you're a resident in need or a visitor seeking a memorable bud, this coffeeshop is a must-visit destination in Koh Samui.\nOverall, this coffeeshop consistently delivers top-notch service and exquisite flowers, making it a standout choice for all your needs.","time":1709927565,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Vee Tom","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115126364495607436266/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXC-aEg32xV-qaZ0r3mvYxEAz1qyINwon-obx4JrmOPi1MOJQaG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"a year ago","text":"friendly staff and good selection of buds. owner just happened to be in while i was there and gave me some Thai weed to sample. it comes ground up and includes all parts of the plant. makes for a tasty smoke and doesn’t get you too blitzed. it’s a cheaper option and definitely worth trying. similar to some homegrown bush weed you’d find in aus. would recommend","time":1695528969,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Blake Wyatt","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115755916227511065622/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKh6LGKoWIJFmNt54wwZVxGuf2R3LEZTyTQO4Sw64qqrQGn9w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"3 weeks ago","text":"Fantastic little place with some of the best prices on Koh Samui. Fantastic quality on the products they grow themselves as well. Definitely worth stopping by","time":1737188264,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Klaudia Kresilova","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105122063804813378180/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJJrWYefzTZ_qB02lm4mP-72vwUmauqwyeEX-5BoRcLWTaNoA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"a year ago","text":"Recommended by friends and for sure not disappointing! Very nice place with friendly and helpful staff. Fantastic prices. You wont find better!","time":1705009955,"translated":false}],"reviews_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJA1St3-nzVDARcbv1l1hQO8M"},{"place_id":"ChIJ8eszLjD3VDARqX380GbzrgE","name":"Arasaka Ganja","address":"เลขที่ 328/10 หมู่ 3, อ่างทอง อ่างทอง, Tambon Ang Thong, Amphoe Ko Samui, Chang Wat Surat Thani 84140, Thailand","geometry":{"location":{"lat":9.5331338,"lng":99.9349653},"viewport":{"northeast":{"lat":9.534506730291502,"lng":99.9361921302915},"southwest":{"lat":9.5318087697085,"lng":99.93349416970848}}},"reviews_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJ8eszLjD3VDARqX380GbzrgE"}]